2026-10-26T20:51:27.5037102Z 
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5046885Z * Status
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5046997Z 
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5047135Z                  /*------------------------------------.
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5047463Z                  | New features need further testing.  |
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5047848Z                  `------------------------------------*/
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5048217Z 
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5048459Z * Autotest parallel testsuite support is still a work in progress.
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5049252Z   There are known issues in job handling under dash and some ksh
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5049777Z   variants, where a parallel testsuite can hang or cause a 100%
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5050294Z   processor load.  In the current release, the overall autoconf
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5050984Z   testsuite only exercises parallel autotest under bash and zsh, or if
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5051612Z   you have defined TEST_PARALLEL_AUTOTEST in the environment.
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5051957Z   Meanwhile, Cygwin has known problems with named fifos that cause
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5052314Z   failures when attempting parallel tests in an autotest suite.  It is
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5052666Z   possible that other difficulties will be encountered, whether with
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5053004Z   shell or platform limitations; help is appreciated in improving
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5053291Z   parallel testsuite support.
2026-10-26T20:51:27.5053438Z 
